          "title": "You'll want to know: विनती",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विनती (vintī) — \"an entreaty\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Usually derived from Sanskrit विज्ञप्ति (vijñapti), 'a respectful making-known', which is what a petition to a king was called. The heavy conjunct in the middle collapsed on its way through Prakrit and left विनती (vintī)."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It sits above कृपया in weight. कृपया goes in front of a request the way 'please' does; विनती (vintī) is the request itself, offered from below, and it turns up in prayer and in a plea as often as in ordinary speech."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Two."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
